<title>SWITZERLAND: ABB DETAILS H1 SEGMENT REVENUES.</title>
<headline>ABB DETAILS H1 SEGMENT REVENUES.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997:</p>
<p>				     (million dollars unless stated)</p>
<p> Group net revenues	15,198		 vs 15,608</p>
<p>of which</p>
<p> Power generation	  3,742		  vs 4,456</p>
<p>Power transmission</p>
<p>  and distribution	 4,062		  vs 4,114</p>
<p>Industrial and building</p>
<p>  systems		    7,246		  vs 7,365</p>
<p> Adtranz -Transportation  793		    vs 809</p>
<p> Financial Services	344		    vs 223</p>
<p> Various Activities	1,556		  vs 1,588</p>
<p> Intra-group transaction 2,545		  vs 2,947</p>
<p> Group total revenues    17,743		 vs 18,555</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is ABB Asea Brown Boveri AG</p>
<p>-- Peter Nielsen, Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
